Per-component licensing

This repository is a collection of configuration files and small helpers.
It does not relicense upstream components under a single blanket license.

1. Hyprland base configuration
   Derived from CachyOS/cachyos-hypr-noctalia, as supplied by the installed
   cachyos-hypr-noctalia package. Its package metadata declares GPL-1.0-only.
   A copy of that license is included in LICENSES/GPL-1.0.txt.
   Upstream: https://github.com/CachyOS/cachyos-hypr-noctalia
   Existing comments and attribution are retained in the configuration files.

2. Local Noctalia plugin overrides
   Better Clock: yugaaank, license MIT as declared in plugin.toml.
   Special Workspaces: jamesfeeder, license MIT as declared in plugin.toml.
   Screen Recording controls: Copyright (c) 2026 Ch3L1k, MIT.
   Original manifests, readmes and in-file notices are retained.
   The MIT permission and disclaimer below apply to these MIT components,
   with their respective original authors retained.

3. Original helper scripts, installer, documentation and original modifications
   Copyright (c) 2026 Ch3L1k. MIT License, subject to the separate upstream
   licensing of any derived files described above.

4. Generated palettes and app templates
   Generated by Noctalia and its templates, with local adjustments. Upstream:
   https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia
   Template provenance is recorded in PROVENANCE.md. Upstream terms and
   original notices continue to apply; no ownership of upstream designs is claimed.
   The repository contains no bundled font, Adwaita icon SVG, or wallpaper image.

